# text = I asked to explain more fully , so that I might not by any chance mislead him , so he said I answered that certainly it would be most easy , but that we solicitors had a system of agency one for the other , so that local work could be done locally on instruction from any solicitor , so that the client , simply placing himself in the hands of one man , could have his wishes carried out by him without further trouble said he I replied , and he said , and then went on to ask about the means of making consignments and the forms to be gone through , and of all sorts of difficulties which might arise , but by forethought could be guarded against .
