# text = Whether it was the purifying of the deadly atmosphere by the opening of the chapel door , or the relief which we experienced by finding ourselves in the open I know not , but most certainly the shadow of dread seemed to slip from us like a robe , and the occasion of our coming lost something of its grim significance , though we did not slacken a whit in our resolution .
